<title>ARGENTINA: ARGENTINE CELULOSA YR NET $109 MLN LOSS.</title>
<headline>ARGENTINE CELULOSA YR NET $109 MLN LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30. Net loss $109 million vs n/a.</p>
<p>NOTE: Celulosa Argentina SA provided neither comparative, EPS nor ADR information. It did not detail second quarter results.</p>
<p>It said first half results were after a $17 million extraordinary loss.</p>
<p>The company reported a net worth of $133.4 million and negative retained earnings of $131.85 million.</p>
<p>((-Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires newsroom, 541 318-0650))</p>
